<p>When you use a steamtech talent while Gestalt is active you drain some residual power to form a psionic shield.</p><p>The shield forms for 3 turns and absorbs <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">83, 112, 134, 153, 170</acronym> damage.</p><p>The effects increase with your Mindpower.</p>